# .transformers-cache/ is deliberately COMMITTED where practical, not
# ignored — some dev/college networks block the Hugging Face hub, which
# otherwise silently breaks a model's first-run auto-download. Committing it
# means a fresh clone works fully offline from the start, no internet needed
# even once. See README "Fully offline / air-gapped setup".
#
# EXCEPTION: the current classifier model
# (Xenova/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2)'s quantized ONNX weights are
# ~118MB — over GitHub's 100MB hard per-file limit — so THAT specific model
# is excluded via the root .gitignore instead and falls back to the normal
# HF-hub auto-download on first run. The original, smaller classifier model
# (Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2, ~23MB) stays committed below.
